<title>FRANCE: Canal Plus plans new digital channel.</title>
<headline>Canal Plus plans new digital channel.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canal Plus, the French pay-tv television station, said on Monday it plans a new digital and interactive channel from November 15.</p>
<p>The channel, to be called &quot;Spectacle&quot; and 100-percent owned by Canal Plus, will be the first interactive tele-shopping channel devoted to cultural events and entertainment, it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
